  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fair Power Structure (PLAC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project seeks to strengthen the legislature and key accountable institutions particularly the National assembly to develop strategic legislative agenda; promote the passage of critical constitutional and electoral reforms through working with relevant committees within the NASS. The project would be working on climate issues and supporting increased citizens engagement on democratic and electoral issues through working with the Nigeria Civil Society Situation Room and other stakeholder groups.</narrative>
  </description>
